---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure - TechReview"
  description="Read how TechReview uses affiliate links, how commissions work, and how we keep our reviews honest and independent."
>

<section class="disclosure-page">

  <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>

  <p class="lead">
    Some links on TechReview are affiliate links. This means we may earn a commission
    if you make a purchase through these links, at no additional cost to you.
  </p>

  <div class="disclosure-card">

    <h2>What Are Affiliate Links?</h2>
    <p>
      Affiliate links are special URLs that let a company know a visitor came from our website.
      If you decide to sign up for a service or purchase a product after clicking one of these links,
      we may receive a small commission or referral fee.
    </p>
    <p>
      This arrangement helps support TechReview and allows us to keep publishing free content,
      guides and reviews.
    </p>

    <h2>How Affiliate Links Affect You</h2>
    <p>
      Using an affiliate link does <strong>not</strong> change the price you pay.
      In many cases, we try to negotiate special discounts or bonuses so that our readers
      get equal or better pricing than going directly to the provider.
    </p>

    <h2>How We Choose Products and Services</h2>
    <p>
      We only recommend tools and services that we believe can genuinely help our readers:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>We consider performance, reliability, support and real user experience.</li>
      <li>We compare pricing, features and limitations across multiple providers.</li>
      <li>Our opinions are based on research and testing, not on which partner pays the highest commission.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Our goal is to give you clear, honest information so you can choose the best option for your situation.
    </p>

    <h2>Independence and Transparency</h2>
    <p>
      We do our best to keep reviews up to date and balanced. However, you should always do your own research
      before making a final decision, especially for long‑term or business‑critical services.
    </p>
    <p>
      If we receive free products, trial accounts or other forms of compensation,
      we aim to disclose this clearly in the relevant content where appropriate.
    </p>

    <h2>Compliance With Affiliate Program Policies</h2>
    <p>
      This disclosure is provided to comply with common affiliate program requirements and
      advertising guidelines. We want to be transparent about how TechReview earns revenue and
      how that may relate to the recommendations you see on this website.
    </p>

    <h2>Your Support</h2>
    <p>
      By using our affiliate links, you help support TechReview without paying anything extra.
      Thank you for trusting our content and for supporting the work that goes into testing,
      researching and writing our guides and reviews.
    </p>

    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>
      If you have any questions about this affiliate disclosure or how we work with partners,
      you can reach us via the <a href="/contact" class="cta-link">contact page</a>.
    </p>

  </div>

</section>

<style>

.disclosure-page{
  max-width:800px;
  margin:60px auto;
  padding:0 20px 40px;
  line-height:1.7;
}

.disclosure-page h1{
  font-size:32px;
  margin-bottom:20px;
  text-align:center;
}

.disclosure-page .lead{
  font-size:18px;
  color:#444;
  margin-bottom:30px;
  text-align:center;
}

.disclosure-card{
  background:white;
  border-radius:12px;
  box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
  padding:25px 20px 30px;
}

.disclosure-card h2{
  margin-top:26px;
  margin-bottom:10px;
  font-size:22px;
}

.disclosure-card p{
  margin-bottom:16px;
  font-size:16px;
  color:#444;
}

.disclosure-card ul{
  padding-left:20px;
  margin:0 0 18px;
  color:#444;
}

.disclosure-card li{
  margin-bottom:8px;
}

.cta-link{
  color:var(--cta);
  font-weight:600;
}

.cta-link:hover{
  color:var(--cta-hover);
  text-decoration:underline;
}

@media (max-width:768px){
  .disclosure-page{
    margin:40px auto;
    padding:0 16px 30px;
  }

  .disclosure-page h1{
    font-size:26px;
  }
}

</style>

</Layout>
